# MyFamily — Product Requirements Document (PRD)

## 0. One-liner
A playful, cross-platform family management app that makes day-to-day coordination effortless—tasks, calendar, groceries, finances, and habits—gamified to reduce friction.

## 1. Goals
- Reduce household overhead by 50% within 30 days.
- Make grocery runs error-free via reusable master lists and per-trip instances.
- Deliver a joyful, game-like experience to encourage consistent use.

## 2. Non-Goals (v1)
- No bank/PLAID integration (manual finances only).
- No GPS tracking or location sharing.
- No web app (mobile-only for v1).

## 3. Personas
- **Organizer (Ava, 34):** Planner, grocery manager, wants automation.
- **Helper (Leo, 36):** Participates; wants low friction and gamification.
- **Teen (Mia, 14):** Chores and habit streaks; motivated by points.

## 4. Product Pillars
1. **Clarity:** Shared single source of truth for all family tasks.
2. **Speed:** One-tap templates, quick actions, real-time sync.
3. **Motivation:** Gamified completion, streaks, and leaderboards.

## 5. Core Features
### Authentication & Family Setup
- Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In for iOS/Android).
- Create or join a family via invite link/code.

### Home Dashboard
- Daily snapshot: upcoming tasks, grocery status, weather, family points.
- Layout matches the provided screenshots (light/dark/system theme).

### Tasks & Chores
- Assign to members; track status (Todo, In Progress, Done).
- Support recurring tasks and point-based completion.

### Calendar
- Monthly + list views.
- Color-coded events per member.

### Grocery Management (Hero Feature)
- **Master Lists/Templates:** Saved sets of groceries (by store/type).
- **Trip Instances:** Spawn from template, assign to a member, allow ad-hoc adds.
- Real-time sync; per-item notes, quantity, category, and completion.
- Suggestions from previous trips.

### Gamification
- Points for completing tasks and grocery trips.
- Streaks for habits.
- Family leaderboard.

### Settings
- Profile, theme mode (system/light/dark), notifications toggle.
- (v1.1) Export data as JSON.

## 6. UX/UI
- Replicate attached screenshots faithfully.
- Use Material 3 with rounded, warm aesthetic.
- Responsive: no overflow on any device; clamp text scaling between 0.9–1.3.
- Support both portrait and landscape (tablet-friendly).

## 7. Success Metrics
- Activation: create/join family + add a task + start grocery trip (Day 1).
- Retention: 30%+ 7-day retention.
- Productivity: 3+ completed tasks per user weekly.

## 8. Privacy & Security
- Each user sees only their family data.
- PII minimized; all analytics anonymized.

## 9. Milestones
- **M0 (Week 1):** Auth + family creation.
- **M1 (Week 2):** Tasks + calendar MVP.
- **M2 (Week 3):** Grocery templates + trip flow.
- **M3 (Week 4):** Gamification, theming, QA, and internal release.

## 10. Acceptance Criteria
- App compiles on Android/iOS with Firebase config prompt.
- Layout matches screenshots across device sizes.
- Text never overflows; all screens safe-area compliant.
- Grocery template/trip works offline and syncs on reconnect.

